# Input default (LOCKED)

When creating an input or search, use the Org EHG Input glass lock in
`src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/org-enterprise-hybrid-glass/org-ehg-input-glass-global-default.ts`.

## Input

Locked command: `ext org-ehg input-glass qa primary stacked md icon-none shape-standard no-shadow`

Product component: `ExitsOrgEhgInput` — use this whenever the surface is Org EHG. Do not invent another EHG input recipe.

## Search

Locked command: `ext org-ehg input-glass qa primary stacked md icon-bare shape-standard no-shadow`

Full recipe: `.cursor/rules/exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`.

UI Standards **Input glass** playground seeds the input lock. Do not invent a flat Material input or Soft Glass field unless the user names Soft Glass primary fields (`exits-soft-glass-primary-fields.mdc`) or another recipe.

## Soft Glass exception

Personal Soft Glass primary field groups still use locked `PlaygroundTextField` / `PlaygroundSearchField` (`ext input primary outlined`) under `exits-soft-glass-primary-fields.mdc`. That Soft Glass path is separate from this global input creation lock.

## Type (when using Soft Glass / Form Components)

The lock in `field-typography-global-default.ts` still covers Soft Glass / Form Components input type (13px label, 14px text). Do not put those type values in the Org EHG input-glass lock file.

Change the Org EHG input/search creation lock only when the user asks. Update `org-ehg-input-glass-global-default.ts`, `org-ehg-input-glass-global-default.test.ts`, `OrgEhgQaInputGlassPlayground.tsx`, `exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`, and this rule together.
